# Every module Tiny Core 16.x ships for 6.12.11-tinycore64 (paths below
# lib/modules/6.12.11-tinycore64/kernel/): corepure64.gz plus all the
# *-6.12.11-tinycore64.tcz in config/cde64. scripts/xxri-sound-modules.py takes
# a dependency of the sound modules from Tiny Core if it's listed here and
# packs it into xxri-sound.tcz if not.
# Regenerate when a Tiny Core module package changes: unpack them and run
#   find <root>/{,usr/local/}lib/modules/6.12.11-tinycore64/kernel -name '*.ko*'
